      "message": "test(sim): pin E2a's CutFromBelow refusal on a flipped bake before the up-march replaces it\n\nA flipped bake (#779) marks itself bounded_cuts so a floor a cut came\nwithin a cell of refuses by name instead of reading the shell's floor\nby the monotone law, which only covers cuts from above. The review of\nPR #784 asked for a direct pin of that interim law before #780's\nmarch_up reads cut_downs; this is it, with the upright bake's unchanged\nlaw pinned beside it.\n\nRefs #780\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
